WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:07.048
Investigators,

00:00:07.048 --> 00:00:08.466
forensics experts,

00:00:08.466 --> 00:00:10.051
true crime jocks...

00:00:10.385 --> 00:00:11.720
nobody has seen 
anything like this one.

00:00:13.096 --> 00:00:14.681
Robert Wone decided 
to spend the night

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:15.849
with three friends.

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:18.685
We have their story, that 
an intruder broke in

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:20.186
and Robert was 
stabbed three times.

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:22.188
One. Two. Three.

00:00:22.272 --> 00:00:22.731
Bang!

00:00:22.814 --> 00:00:24.524
The story just took 
off from there.

00:00:24.983 --> 00:00:27.360
The detectives walked 
into a surreal scene.

00:00:27.944 --> 00:00:30.196
The level of depravity 
is stunning.

00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:32.991
There were needle 
marks on his neck.

00:00:34.451 --> 00:00:35.994
Something was very off.

00:00:36.453 --> 00:00:38.997
You don't take three to the 
chest, lay there and die.

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:41.833
That's what makes this 
story so maddening.

00:00:42.459 --> 00:00:43.626
This case has 
more questions

00:00:43.626 --> 00:00:44.627
than it has answers.

00:00:45.837 --> 00:00:47.422
There's no evidence 
of struggle.

00:00:48.298 --> 00:00:50.258
There was almost no 
blood on the scene.

00:00:51.134 --> 00:00:52.135
Where is the missing blood?

00:00:54.304 --> 00:00:56.222
When I die, the first question 
I'm gonna ask God–

